{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Perfect! Now I can see the schemas:\n\n1. Farmers markets table has:\n   - state_name, state_abbr, farmers_markets (column with the count)\n   - The farmers_markets column contains the count for each state\n\n2. Census population table has:\n   - NAME column (state names)\n   - POPESTIMATE2025 column (2025 population)\n   \nI need to:\n1. Get the total farmers markets excluding territories (so I need to exclude Puerto Rico, Virgin Islands, Guam, American Samoa, Northern Mariana Islands)\n2. Get the 2025 population for the 'United States' row from the census file\n3. Calculate the ratio\n\nLet me first peek at the data to understand it better.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01ND6RoHAigYU6WtSayb3Yrc","name":"xorq_select","arguments":{"catalog_path":".xorq/catalog","on":"farmers_markets","compose":"source.limit(10)"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01MwUk8TbJEbL97zRsNTJuEb","name":"xorq_select","arguments":{"catalog_path":".xorq/catalog","on":"census_population","compose":"source.filter(source.NAME == 'United States').limit(5)"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","usage":{"input":14,"output":377,"cacheRead":15619,"cacheWrite":1465,"totalTokens":17475,"cost":{"input":0.000014,"output":0.0018850000000000002,"cacheRead":0.0015619000000000002,"cacheWrite":0.00183125,"total":0.005292150000000001},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":176},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786911580112,"responseId":"msg_011Ce73gTaQN45ppHgKu152C","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},"toolResults":[{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01ND6RoHAigYU6WtSayb3Yrc","toolName":"xorq_select","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\"state_name\",\"state_abbr\",\"farmers_markets\",\"csa_programs\",\"farm_stands\",\"snap_ebt_markets\",\"snap_ebt_pct\",\"organic_vendor_markets\",\"organic_pct\",\"markets_with_website\",\"website_pct\"\n\"California\",\"CA\",647,95